        </div>

        <div class="row g-4">

            <div class="col-md-4 fade-up" style="transition-delay:.05s;">
                <div class="connect-card">
                    <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="fa-solid fa-church"></i></div>
                    <h5>Sunday Gatherings</h5>
                    <p>We gather weekly to sing together, learn from the Scriptures, serve one another, and make space for God's grace.</p>
                    <p class="mt-2" style="color:#ff9aa4;font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;">
                        <i class="fa-regular fa-clock me-1"></i>8:00AM &amp; 10:30AM &amp; 6:00PM
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4 fade-up" style="transition-delay:.12s;">
                <div class="connect-card">
                    <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="fa-solid fa-people-group"></i></div>
                    <h5>Bible Study</h5>
